%% Brand identification & flashcards — simplified (no rate limits / infra)
%% Render: npx -y @mermaid-js/mermaid-cli -i docs/brand-identification-flow.mmd -o docs/brand-identification-flow.svg

flowchart TB
  Start([Short video clip]) --> Frames[Extract frames at 1 fps]
  Frames --> Vision[Vision model: brands in each frame]
  Vision --> Merge[Merge duplicates across frames]
  Merge --> Any{Any brands found?}
  Any -->|no| Empty([No flashcards])
  Any -->|yes| Place{Rate placement? optional}
  Place -->|yes| Sentiment[Vision: placement sentiment per brand]
  Place -->|no| Brands[List of brands + context]
  Sentiment --> Brands

  Brands --> Each[For each brand]
  Each --> Search{Use Google Search? optional}
  Search -->|no| Draft[Write flashcard from model knowledge]
  Search -->|yes| Web[Search web then write flashcard]
  Web --> Draft2[Flashcard + source links]
  Draft --> Check[Self-check: is the card good enough?]
  Draft2 --> Check
  Check --> Ok{Confidence OK?}
  Ok -->|yes| Card([Flashcard for brand])
  Ok -->|no, one retry left| Hints[Refine with missing-fact hints]
  Hints --> Draft
  Ok -->|no, out of retries| Card
  Card --> Each
  Card --> Done([All flashcards shown in UI])
